<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Matsushita year net up 3.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Matsushita year net up 3.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		     (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		59.81	 vs	  57.75</p>
<p>    Shr	    (cents) 184.0	  vs	 178.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 783.33	 vs	 753.38</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  78.01	 vs	  75.12</p>
<p>    Dividend     (cents)  70.0	  vs	  50.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Electric Co (Malaysia) Bhd is a 43-percent associate of Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd of Japan. It makes and sells electronic consumer products and household appliances.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
